                                "sense_id": "9e4d6ab3-c50e-379d-b356-1ffb70bb05af",
                                "text": "But \"imitation\" throws no light upon why they so act; it repeats the fact as an explanation of itself. It is an explanation of the same order as the famous saying that opium puts men to sleep because of its dormitive power."
